  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 1267842,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "Delve into a treasure trove of PlayStation 2 gaming history with this unique \"10th Anniversary Memorial Save Data\" disc, a component of the LaunchBox encyclopedia. This isn't a game itself, but a curated collection of save data from 1467 different PS2 titles, spanning the console's golden years. Imagine instantly accessing progress in a variety of games – from sprawling RPGs to adrenaline-pumping action adventures, and everything in between.\n\nThis disc offers a fascinating glimpse into the diverse gaming landscape of the early 2000s, allowing players to experience pivotal moments and overcome challenging sections without the grind. While it doesn't offer a singular narrative, it provides a shortcut to experiencing a vast library of games. Perfect for collectors, retro enthusiasts, or anyone curious about the breadth of the PS2’s library, this save data disc is a tangible piece of PlayStation history, offering a unique and convenient way to sample a wide range of gaming experiences. A must-have for those seeking a nostalgic journey through the PS2 era."
    },
